assessment.verification_assessment:
Acceptance is observable under local fake time. The verifier can check that:
- episode termination and restart reconstruct identical authorized actions;
- a stale-epoch send is refused;
- attention persists across restart;
- completed judgment suppresses liveness recovery;
- stopped or stale scans report DEGRADED/STALE rather than healthy;
- duplicate/delayed outcomes yield one effect/readback identity.
The four failure classes each have a required discriminating negative control, and there is a bounded pytest command, so a fresh verifier on the exact candidate SHA can reach one coherent ACCEPT/REJECT verdict. The explicit non-claims (no host supervision, live transport, cutover or retirement) keep the verdict scoped to local proof. The 'identical authorized actions' predicate should be made concrete in the fixture so the verdict is not subjective.
